 \u00e1rboles, Trocha Shihuahuaco, escalada en Clibing a una plataforma lupuna, y en la misma Hacienda Herrera.\nAdem\u00e1s 4 videos con contenido exclusivo de c\u00e1maras trampa en la selva de madre de Dios.", "short_description": "Primer aplicativo con recorridos 360\u00b0 de la selva en Puerto Maldonado"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logo-512.png", "id": "2055343438150768", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572927_2055343441484101_8652722561279519607_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VYq5F6QHkpMQ7kNvwE6C9mR&_nc_oc=AdotYj4ht7AiB_S4xVzVrIa7lH5ee4fUK2wjUem2cYMZJiTCOWGHEkQN8L7Iy8Py_-M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXc1Cm_cbgdPsTZo4GTCxYrngbSn-j9ii8gn5fgFnlU4w&oe=6B0F0254"}, {"file_name": "1440 HH.png", "id": "1725009814685831", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570294_1725009818019164_2794798217413603034_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CW027azyTCcQ7kNvwGqk-v5&_nc_oc=AdoKUdzTUX-zlIv_1UxAIl-qvTzPPDpLywl8COIKw4V-_mzyP0Al5HnlMyrpF0jyok0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXueU-VlDk7H2r31B0DCDtSz3pB5h_uNctcxZVVvfc_GQ&oe=6B0EF89D"}, {"file_name": "7x10HH.png", "id": "1264346464967416", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031597_1264346468300749_4624995628890807215_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XMr3s49LRJkQ7kNvwGgXudV&_nc_oc=AdqXlb0PQ5DWzc88YJoRnMqSklM5FPs9ni7vNpvGMaxZRoEPws92ncCMKbaR_UgmvCQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXNufhrFPX0RfCVZqM94co_x8Y4yQIRHGifQ9xbmTqMEg&oe=6B0EECB4"}, {"file_name": "Mesa de trabajo 3hherrera.png", "id": "705420821469944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-2